WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:03.850
<b>Alarm</b>

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:05.630
I thought I had to be the person you admired.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:09.070
Every day. Every day. Every day.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.210
I tied myself down that way.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.350
So I'm going to get stronger.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.660
I'll win the Selector battles and be rid of you.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.500
You changed your alarm, didn't you, Kou?

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:23.770
Yes.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.830
Is she your new favorite?

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:27.660
Yes.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.960
Pretty voice, right?

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.480
Of course. I'm...

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.350
She's so desperate.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.090
It's cute.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.430
It's hard dealing with someone so clueless.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.270
I wish she'd think about the one she's 
teasing and blue-balling all the time.

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.330
You really have a sick personality.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.520
Well, you know...

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.740
Why not have fun?

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.730
This world is crap. You have to enjoy it.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.030
That's true.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Darkness / Fervent Desire and Loss

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:33.580
Um...

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:37.980
I'll use Crisis Chance to play 
DateMasa, and take OdaNobu and...

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:38.880
Rise!

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:41.260
Certainty.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.100
You've won the game.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.720
Really?

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.260
Unique.

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.920
The way you fight isn't bound 
by traditional technique.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.300
That's what makes you special.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.420
It throws your opponent off their rhythm.

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.700
Is that a compliment?

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.370
Of course, it was intended as one.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.150
Yay!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.160
That makes me super happy.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:02.820
Thank you.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:04.900
Candor.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:08.440
I'm only stating what I saw.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:11.460
Suzuko-san's really changed, huh?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:15.960
Compared to how she was at 
the start, she's so much stronger.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:19.390
What did you do to train her?

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:22.760
Suzuko is trying to protect what 
she cares about. That's all.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.350
Her memories, yes?

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.960
Hanna-sama is quite obsessed 
with them, as well.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.730
Are they that great?

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.530
You have one coin left.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.370
And very little time.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.000
What's this photo?

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.870
Tell me, Donor.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.630
Shou-chan, let's fight.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.900
I'm sure if you do, you'll...

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.940
Sorry. I kept you waiting, huh?

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.950
Morikawa, I...

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:24.620
Don't worry.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.660
I'll go with you.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:33.370
Master, here is your payment for today!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.460
Rejoicing.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.000
These are...

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.920
Muff-Muff chocolate muffins!

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:42.950
This scent... Is there banana in them?

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:45.800
Tasting.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.810
Let's try it.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:51.920
Delicious!

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.660
Chocolate-banana is divine!

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:54.850
Oh, good...

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.310
Actually, I made them.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.160
Sorry, my allowance is running a little low.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.030
But it's my mother's secret recipe,

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:06.000
so I'm pretty sure they're good.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:11.430
Did you often cook with your mother?

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:16.100
No, she got sick and passed 
away when I was little.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.580
I see.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:24.210
She never felt well, but she taught 
me how to cook all the time.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:28.430
But then she couldn't anymore.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:31.110
For a while, I just cried all the time,

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:35.320
but Chi-chan made me feel better.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:39.680
She said she'd always be there for me.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:41.570
Confession.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.530
I've lost family, too.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:52.600
Seven years ago, my younger 
brother, Yuuto, left me.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.630
Hanna-chan, we'll go over there next!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.980
Yuuto, you're running too fast!

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.720
Yuuto?

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:08.490
Poor thing...

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:11.280
I heard he fell from an apartment 
building under construction.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:14.680
<i>Why wasn't I with Yuuto?</i>

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:17.680
<i>Why don't I remember anything?</i>

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:20.910
<i>Why...</i>

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:27.360
Hanna, your friends are here. They're worried.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.110
Refusal.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.160
I don't want to see them.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.040
This is supposed to be "in" now. 
Why not play it with your friends?
—Nee-chan

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.850
I am the LRIG of the beginning.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:46.170
I will register your memories.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.680
Rules. I learned of them.

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.350
Wish.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:57.400
If I won, I could have a piece 
of the puzzle I wanted.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.960
Contradiction.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:05.020
The idea of remembering 
everything feels a little scary.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:10.590
But I think I have to get them back.

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:16.870
Hi there!

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:18.790
You're Shirai-kun, huh?

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:20.740
Who's this guy?

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:23.260
He's the bookmaker, Satomi.

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:26.170
And right now, I'm Chinatsu-chan's employer.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.130
Employer?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:32.160
She asked me for a job.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.010
That's not—

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.060
I'd prefer we talked about the contract.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:39.480
Oh, that's right! You did it 
with Chinatsu-chan, right?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.740
A battle, I mean.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.020
I'm so jealous.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.660
So, how was she while you 
were doing the deed?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.820
You...

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.560
Oh, sorry, sorry.

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.210
Yeah, of course.

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:59.580
You want the girl you love all to yourself.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.860
Hey...

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.200
Shirai-kun!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.340
What's with you?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.380
Didn't you want a contract?

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.510
What are you thinking?!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.260
You're crazy, working for a guy like that.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:17.410
You're forcing yourself to do this, aren't you?

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.220
I asked for all of it.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:22.020
But the old you wouldn't have...

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.350
It's none of your business!

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:27.380
I can't leave you like this.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.480
Your words saved me.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.060
That the time I spent wasn't wasted...

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.490
That I couldn't forget it.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.060
And that girl....

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.570
Suzuko-chan, she also...

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.840
You're tying me down, too?

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:43.660
Morikawa?

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:47.130
I'm different.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.340
I'm different than I used to be.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.760
Poor Chi-chan...

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:03.530
No one understands you. You're all alone.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:08.260
I'm just trying to go forward...

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:12.650
Why is everyone acting like it's my fault?

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.780
Don't worry.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.990
I know all about you.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:24.330
Shou-chan, was it right to make that contract?

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:28.930
She was shaking...

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.920
<b>My First 
Simple! Happy! Sweets</b>

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.690
What are you planning to make?

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:39.540
Mistaken!

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:42.780
I'm not planning to return 
the favor or anything...

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:45.400
I wasn't asking that at all.

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:49.770
No battle lesson today?

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:51.200
Postponed.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.810
Suzuko-san has plans, it seems.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:56.200
And that's why you seem so bored?

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:56.860
Mistaken.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:58.610
That's not...

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:01.330
Useful.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.740
With her current skill,

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.500
<b>Month      Day     Capacity</b>

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:07.500
she's a good player to practice against.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.640
You're quite enthusiastic.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:10.520
Of course.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:11.500
I have four coins.

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:15.200
One more win, and my wish comes true.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.430
And I have good news for you.

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.600
I sense a Selector nearby.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.600
Here's today's batch.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.240
Thanks.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.020
See you.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.700
Keep it up.

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:33.800
Chi-chan! Chi-chan!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:34.950
What?

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:37.070
Don't talk to me too much outside.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:41.320
You forgot Shirai-kun's contract.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.840
Why didn't you give it to him?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.710
I don't need to tell you that.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.960
Are you thinking you don't want to involve him?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:53.580
Of course not!

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.470
Once you make a decision,

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:58.470
you're not weak enough to change your mind—

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.240
No! I...

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.050
Then prove it.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.260
In front of her.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.680
Her?

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.270
Chi-chan...

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:14.330
Excuse me.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:16.190
Are you a Selector?

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.950
I request a battle.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:20.600
Is now a good time?

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:31.160
Wait!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.080
I've decided!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.790
I won't give up my memories of you.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.600
I'll win the battles if I have to!

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:39.400
Do what you like.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:41.760
I'll get stronger!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:45.720
I'll get stronger so I won't have to rely on you!

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:49.660
If I do, you won't have to lose 
your memories, right?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.020
Suzu...

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.280
Light is a strange thing, isn't it?

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:08.000
It can blind you to a thing it shines 
upon, or make it stand out more.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:11.330
But you've made your choice, haven't you?

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.290
Tell her.

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.710
Nothing will change for me.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.470
If you won't disappear, I'll make you disappear.

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:24.310
My memories, and you.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.360
I love it...

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.300
Oh, well.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:42.610
I'll just have to have them 
make me feel better today.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.320
Answer me.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:48.820
Why are you investigating Selector battles?

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.140
Sudden.

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:52.320
Why do you ask?

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:53.160
Tell me.

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:54.620
Request.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.920
If you have questions,

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.670
please fight me first.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.280
I see...

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:00.130
Very well.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:01.480
Introduction.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.180
My name is Mikage Hanna.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.180
I am Kiyoi.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:09.430
Mizushima Kiyoi.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:13.160
Is this really the right place?

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.840
They said my opponent was a secret...

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.560
Forget that!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:22.340
Do you understand the situation 
you're in, Onii-chan?

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.380
I've got one coin left.

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:25.580
I'm up against the wall.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.990
If you get that, then freaking give it your all!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.850
I still don't know anything yet.

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.780
I won't let it end here.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:33.790
They're here!

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:44.010
Hey, Narumi-oniichan!

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:46.750
Oh, it's you, Satomi-san?

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.080
What are you doing here?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.390
Onii-chan, he's a Selector!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.860
So...

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:54.850
Let's do this.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.400
Wait, my opponent is...

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.680
Kou, you've been hiding it all this time.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.730
You should really explain things.

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:05.060
Oh, right...

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:08.800
Well, why not just tell him about his sister?

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.700
Oh, about my battle with Aya-chan?

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.680
Your battle with Aya?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.660
You mean...

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:19.120
You know something about Aya?

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.890
You do, don't you?!

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:24.090
Why don't we talk about it while we battle?

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:26.970
I'm in a violent mood today.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:32.140
Suzuko...

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.620
Don't worry.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.780
I won't hesitate anymore.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:38.810
Um, are you a Selector?

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.360
If you want a battle, I accept.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.040
Open!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.370
Piruluk, grow.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.490
Destruct Through.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.700
Anonymous-chan!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.290
I'm still fine.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.760
Powerful.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.680
I admit it.

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:10.720
You have the upper hand in the battle.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.580
But I can't lose!

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:16.500
Deploy SIGNI and coin bet!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:17.350
Blind.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.280
Turn end!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:21.160
Kiyoi.

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:21.960
Yes.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.860
Coin bet.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:27.370
Peeping.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.310
Level 4.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:42.570
Attachment to lost memories.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:46.040
Excessive curiosity about the Selector battles.

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:47.930
Clairvoyance...

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.050
She's reading my mind.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.480
Yes.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.840
I've seen many wishes,

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:56.090
and how serious they were.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:59.720
And the terrible end those feelings met.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.650
You still don't know about these battles.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.090
No, you can still go back.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.160
Mikage Hanna,

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:11.270
you must not go any further.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.300
Hey, Riru.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:20.290
I'm going to get stronger.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:22.050
Yeah.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.710
Now, then... My turn.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.820
Wait!

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:29.010
Tell me about your battle with Aya!

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:30.590
She's all I care about!

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:34.350
But I don't know how to explain it.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:37.720
We fought and she disappeared, I guess.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:39.930
Disappeared...

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:42.320
Disappeared...

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.770
Onii-chan, you're in the middle of a battle!

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.440
You...

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.900
You erased her?

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:50.040
What did you do to Aya?!

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:51.570
What did I do?

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:54.820
Want me to fight the same 
battle I did with her?

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.860
That's right.

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:01.360
She started with a crap hand,

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.120
and I took advantage of that.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.920
Here I go, "Onii-chan."

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:08.860
Summon Antaras.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:09.750
Additional draw.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.340
Attack.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:17.590
Defend!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.050
You bastard, if you're going to block—

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:23.810
Shut up!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.440
Don't tell me what to do!

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.610
I love it!

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:28.900
Aya-chan sucked at defending, too!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.470
You...

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.880
You did that to Aya.

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.300
You'll pay.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:39.530
I'll make you pay, Satomi!

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.040
He's falling for it.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:42.910
Grow!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:44.860
Summon Comrus!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:45.750
Set a trap—

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:47.440
It's gone!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:48.920
What are you doing?!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.840
Bravo!

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:51.680
That's a brother for you!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.950
You really surprised me.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.370
You're doing the exact same thing she did.

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:58.180
It's worth recreating the battle.

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.350
Coin bet!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:05.820
Holograph!

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:11.280
Team Aya is here!

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.940
Back us up!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.420
I love it.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:18.280
He's materializing his 
desires as her big brother.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.160
Grow.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.180
I'm not sure...

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.660
Who should I take first?

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:26.700
Her.

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:31.680
Aya!

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:32.580
Bingo!

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:34.450
Glad I didn't get it wrong!

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:38.860
Aya-chan saw her coin skill 
get defeated right away, too.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.260
She was as mentally weak as you are.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.160
You...

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:43.890
How can you say that about my sister?!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.810
Please, don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.610
I was an LRIG then.

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:50.900
An LRIG?

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:51.770
Yes.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.920
I was obeying someone who 
gave me orders, just like you.

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:59.490
Although he ended up as me, 
the one you see before you now.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.710
Don't you think you're telling him too much?

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:02.810
It's fine.

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:06.670
Narumi-oniichan is going 
to end up like his sister.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.430
That's right.

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.910
He's going to disappear.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.960
Hey, hey! You're supposed 
to beg for your life!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.000
Aya-chan cried when she begged for hers.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:17.210
"Save me, Onii-chan," she said.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.170
Hey, you!

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.540
I'm glad her big brother finally heard.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:33.540
Even if he didn't make it in time.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:35.060
Turn end.

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:38.830
OutDust!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.820
Whoops, madness.

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:45.700
Moridra.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:51.120
I've gotten rid of all that excitement 
building up inside me.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.220
Ready to end it?

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.710
Not much point in asking.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.300
He can't get it up anymore.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:01.520
Aya... A-Aya...

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:07.010
You humans really do respond 
in the greatest ways.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.160
Don't worry.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.810
You kept me company right up until the end.

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:14.070
I'll let you finish it.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.540
Coin bet.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:17.810
Joker.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:21.550
Change Garnet Star to Kosaki.

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:24.610
I'll say goodbye with the same card 
I used to erase Aya-chan.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.610
His card...

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:26.740
That's cheating!

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.480
Supernova.

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:32.510
Bye-bye, Onii-chan.

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:42.670
Defeat.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.680
And a complete one, too.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:48.500
You should stop investigating Selector battles.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.880
You can't see the depths of the darkness.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:53.470
If you step into it, you'll just be swallowed up.

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:54.720
Doubt.

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.760
Why are you telling me this?

00:20:57.760 --> 00:20:58.360
Are you...

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.570
I really do love the battles.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:13.420
So, how does the air of this world feel?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.370
Disgusting.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.560
And I don't wanna be in a guy's body, anyway!

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:21.920
Don't say that.

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:25.260
Like hell I want to see this face 
in the mirror every morning.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:30.330
Well, if you hate it that much, 
you could always fight me again.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:31.970
But you can't change this.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:35.900
Still, you know, this world isn't that bad.

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:39.360
If you think it's bland, add some spice.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.320
How?

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:42.840
For example,

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:45.750
allying yourself with me to repay them.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:47.030
Repay them?

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:48.320
Yes.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:51.970
Repaying the humans who used us 
for their own ends.

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:54.910
In the worst, and best, way possible.

00:23:26.520 --> 00:23:28.280
I'll tell you about this twisted world,

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:32.140
and what the Selector battles are.

00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:32.140
I have no intention of stopping.

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:34.890
Is that really the end of everything?

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:36.020
Why do you fight?

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:38.040
This is goodbye, Hanna-sama.

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:38.040
You're quite greedy, Hanna-chan.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:41.020
Truth / Ending and Beginning

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:41.020
Next time: Truth / Ending and Beginning.
